Prices match Ledger: interleaved commodities and years across included files.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight prices

========== LEDGER-CLI ==========

ledger --args-only --date-format %Y-%m-%d --no-pager prices --sort date,account

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity ZEBRA
  format 1000 ZEBRA
commodity ALPHA
  format 1000 ALPHA
commodity Long_Fund_Name
  format 1000 Long_Fund_Name
commodity UNUSED
  format 1000 UNUSED
account Assets:Funds
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
account Income:Gains
include quotes.ledger

2023-12-29 Opening Zebra
  Assets:Funds  1 ZEBRA {8 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -8 SEK

2023-12-29 Opening Alpha
  Assets:Funds  1 ALPHA {5 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -5 SEK

========== FILE quotes.ledger ==========

P 2024-02-01 ZEBRA 12.345 SEK
P 2024-01-01 ALPHA 7 SEK
P 2023-12-31 ZEBRA 9 SEK
P 2024-01-01 ZEBRA 11 SEK
P 2023-12-31 ALPHA 6 SEK
P 2023-01-01 UNUSED 999 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2023-12-29 ALPHA        5.00 SEK
2023-12-29 ZEBRA        8.00 SEK
2023-12-31 ALPHA        6.00 SEK
2023-12-31 ZEBRA        9.00 SEK
2024-01-01 ALPHA        7.00 SEK
2024-01-01 ZEBRA       11.00 SEK
2024-02-01 ZEBRA      12.345 SEK
